    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464500/extras/42e1e9e21802e29765eaf70c5824f6dd.poster.avif?t=1754547650\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464500/extras/42e1e9e21802e29765eaf70c5824f6dd.webm?t=1754547650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Kittens are having a great time in the playground.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find kitties in places such as swings, slides, a trampoline, or a bouncy castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Cats Playground\u00a0 is a hidden objects/hidden creatures game. The player's task is to find all kitties hiden on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464500/extras/8cad4357dd7db4f90a59d583099e2cf2.poster.avif?t=1754547650\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464500/extras/8cad4357dd7db4f90a59d583099e2cf2.webm?t=1754547650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464500/extras/8cad4357dd7db4f90a59d583099e2cf2.mp4?t=1754547650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hidden Cats : Playground&quot; is decorated with atmospheric and hand-drawn graphics, the cats are cozy and cute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464500/extras/dab3682c4fb4ed8c307fc806a630786c.avif?t=1754547650\" width=558 height=179 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 200 creatures to find. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hand-drawn graphics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >progress record</p>",
